  "body": {
    "type": "doc",
    "content": [
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "A good "
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "paratha",
            "marks": [
              {
                "type": "glossaryTooltip",
                "attrs": {
                  "termSlug": "paratha"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " depends on two things: a dry filling and a well-rested dough. A wet filling causes the bread to burst during rolling. "
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Amchur",
            "marks": [
              {
                "type": "glossaryTooltip",
                "attrs": {
                  "termSlug": "amchur"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " powder in the filling is traditional but lemon juice works if you cannot find it."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Roll the filled paratha slowly and evenly. If the filling breaks through, patch the dough and keep rolling."
          }
        ]
      },
